usage: plan.py log [-h] [--plans-root PLANS_ROOT] --type
                   {deviation,blocker,difficulty,assumption,note} --summary
                   SUMMARY [--impact IMPACT] [--next NEXT] [--ref REF]
                   [--actor ACTOR]
                   plan target

record friction for an item or phase

positional arguments:
  plan                  plan id, PLAN<N> or path
  target                Pn.m or Pn

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --plans-root PLANS_ROOT
                        plans/ directory (default: nearest up from cwd)
  --type {deviation,blocker,difficulty,assumption,note}
  --summary SUMMARY
  --impact IMPACT
  --next NEXT
  --ref REF
  --actor ACTOR         PROVIDER/MODEL[/EFFORT] (default: the item executor,
                        else plan authoring)
